               python3-setuptools,
Standards-Version: 4.1.4
Homepage: https://www.hifiberry.com/

Package: hifiberry-usbaudio
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, pipewire, kmod, hifiberry-configurator
Description: HiFiBerry USB audio gadget service
 Presents the HiFiBerry device to a host computer as a class-compliant UAC2
 USB sound card, and routes the received audio to the HiFiBerry DAC using
 PipeWire. Requires USB device mode, which is enabled with
 'config-configtxt --enable-usb-gadget'.
